{"surah":94,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"arabic":"أَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَكَ صَدۡرَكَ","translit":"Alam nashrah laka sadraka","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast"}},{"n":2,"arabic":"وَوَضَعۡنَا عَنكَ وِزۡرَكَ","translit":"WawadaAAna AAanka wizraka","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And We removed from you your burden"}},{"n":3,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهۡرَكَ","translit":"Allathee anqada thahraka","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Which had weighed upon your back"}},{"n":4,"arabic":"وَرَفَعۡنَا لَكَ ذِكۡرَكَ","translit":"WarafaAAna laka thikraka","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And raised high for you your repute"}},{"n":5,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرًا","translit":"Fainna maAAa alAAusri yusran","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease"}},{"n":6,"arabic":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرࣰ ا","translit":"Inna maAAa alAAusri yusran","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease"}},{"n":7,"arabic":"فَإِذَا فَرَغۡتَ فَٱنصَبۡ","translit":"Faitha faraghta fainsab","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]"}},{"n":8,"arabic":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرۡغَب","translit":"Waila rabbika fairghab","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing"}}]}